## Numpy
NumPy is a general-purpose array-processing package. It provide high performance mutidimentional array object, and tool for working with these arrays. It is a fundamental package for scientific computing with Python.

#### What is an Array
An Array is a data structure that stores values of same data type. In Python, this is the main difference between array ans list. While pythind list contains values corresponding to different data types, array in python can only contain values corresponding to same data type.


